{
    "title": "Join Blob Clash 3D: Mob Runner",
    "description": "Get ready to rush through an epic race in Join Blob Clash, a 3D runner game where you control your own jelly blob. As a runner, you'll navigate through various obstacles, overcome challenges, and face off against the blob boss at the end of each level. This action-packed game offers a thrilling blend of races, battles, and intense clashes.\r\n\r\nIn Join Blob Clash, you'll experience the adrenaline rush of running at full speed, utilizing shortcuts and shifting your strategy to gain an advantage. As a runner, you'll scale walls, roll through tight spaces, and make quick decisions to avoid obstacles. Your goal is to reach the finish line in exhilarating races.\r\n\r\nCollect power-ups along the way to enhance your abilities, whether it's a jelly muscle power-up that gives you extra strength, or a rich energy source.\r\n\r\nMaster the art of running with jelly mobs. The clash of blobs and the battle for supremacy make each race a thrilling spectacle. Claim the title of the ultimate runner. Join Blob Clash is not just about individual competition; it's about forming a crowd of runners united in their pursuit of victory. Merge with other runners to create a powerful mob. As you join forces with fellow runners, you become a formidable force that cannot be easily defeated.\r\n\r\nWith its captivating gameplay and vibrant graphics, Join Blob Clash immerses you in a world where jelly people come together to participate in exhilarating races.\r\n\r\nPrepare to embark on a journey that will take you through a variety of environments, from marble-filled arenas to obstacle-laden courses. Feel the rush as you sprint through each level. Overcome every obstacle in your path, be it a tricky number puzzle, or a maze of obstacles. As you progress through levels, you'll get coins that you can use to customize your blobs with cool costumes. Want to make your crowd look like secret agents, ninjas or other unique characters? No problem! In Join Blob Clash, the possibilities are endless.\r\n\r\nJoin Blob Clash is a mobile game designed for those who seek adrenaline-pumping action on the go. It's a game that merges the thrill of running with the convenience of mobile gaming.\r\n\r\nStart your epic journey! Control the mob in Join Blob Clash with its many features, challenging levels, and addictive gameplay. Don't wait \u2013 join the race and see if you have what it takes to come out on top!\r\n\r\n Don't forget to check out the company community on YouTube at  https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready to rush through an epic race in Join Blob Clash, a 3D runner game where you control your own jelly blob. As a runner, you&#39;ll navigate through various obstacles, overcome challenges, and face off against the blob boss at the end of each level. This action-packed game offers a thrilling blend of races, battles, and intense clashes.<br><br>In Join Blob Clash, you&#39;ll experience the adrenaline rush of running at full speed, utilizing shortcuts and shifting your strategy to gain an advantage. As a runner, you&#39;ll scale walls, roll through tight spaces, and make quick decisions to avoid obstacles. Your goal is to reach the finish line in exhilarating races.<br><br>Collect power-ups along the way to enhance your abilities, whether it&#39;s a jelly muscle power-up that gives you extra strength, or a rich energy source.<br><br>Master the art of running with jelly mobs. The clash of blobs and the battle for supremacy make each race a thrilling spectacle. Claim the title of the ultimate runner. Join Blob Clash is not just about individual competition; it&#39;s about forming a crowd of runners united in their pursuit of victory. Merge with other runners to create a powerful mob. As you join forces with fellow runners, you become a formidable force that cannot be easily defeated.<br><br>With its captivating gameplay and vibrant graphics, Join Blob Clash immerses you in a world where jelly people come together to participate in exhilarating races.<br><br>Prepare to embark on a journey that will take you through a variety of environments, from marble-filled arenas to obstacle-laden courses. Feel the rush as you sprint through each level. Overcome every obstacle in your path, be it a tricky number puzzle, or a maze of obstacles. As you progress through levels, you&#39;ll get coins that you can use to customize your blobs with cool costumes. Want to make your crowd look like secret agents, ninjas or other unique characters? No problem! In Join Blob Clash, the possibilities are endless.<br><br>Join Blob Clash is a mobile game designed for those who seek adrenaline-pumping action on the go. It&#39;s a game that merges the thrill of running with the convenience of mobile gaming.<br><br>Start your epic journey! Control the mob in Join Blob Clash with its many features, challenging levels, and addictive gameplay. Don&#39;t wait \u2013 join the race and see if you have what it takes to come out on top!<br><br> Don&#39;t forget to check out the company community on YouTube at  https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
